{"title":"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfy the inequality\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3dd1ad272fd8a547d857b5700f6a79e0edd918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-2006)(x-2004)(x-2002)\\cdots (x-4)&lt;0?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"373\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are 1002 terms in that polynomial, and the product is less than 0 when an odd number of them are less than 0, and that happens when x is 2005, 2001, 1997, .... , or 5. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e44b7de8ba14e987cb94543781629818c089c22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{501}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" /> numbers in that list.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST\">2006 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 Alabam